  "characterDescription": "A minimal, typographically restrained navigation using Space Grotesk at medium weight, with a transparent absolute positioning that inverts from dark to light on scroll via class toggle. The dropdown system features bold rounded panels with generous padding, signaling a modern SaaS or creative-tech brand that prioritizes clarity and structural confidence over decorative flourish."
